1b5|n|The act of advancing, or the state of being advanced; progression; improvement; furtherance; promotion to a higher place or dignity; as, the advancement of learning. ; An advance of money or value; payment in advance. See Advance, 5. ; Property given, usually by a parent to a child, in advance of a future distribution. ; Settlement on a wife, or jointure.	v:b13,56,1~b13,56,1	n:b13,92,12~b13,92,12
